doctype html
html(lang="en")
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        title Currency API Documentation (Version 0 - Under Development)
    body
        h1 Currency API Documentation
        p Base URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}
        p This API allows managing currency exchange rates including adding, retrieving, and deleting rates.

        h2 Authentication
        p Some endpoints (Post, Delete) require JWT authentication. Include token in
            strong Authorization
            |  header:
        pre Authorization: Bearer &lt;your_jwt_token&gt;

        h2 Endpoints

        h3 1. Get all uploaders
        p
            strong GET /uploaderList
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}uploaderList

        h3 2. Get sources by uploader
        p
            strong GET /sourceList?uploader=&lt;uploader&gt;
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}sourceList?uploader=testuser

        h3 3. Get currency list by source & uploader
        p
            strong GET /currencyList?source=&lt;source&gt;&uploader=&lt;uploader&gt;
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}currencyList?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser

        h3 4. Add a new currency rate (JWT required)
        p
            strong POST /add
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}add

        h3 5. Delete a currency rate (JWT required)
        p
            strong DELETE /delete/:id
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}delete/64e8d3f2a2b7b2a5c1f12345

        h3 6. Get a currency rate by ID (Return Percentage Change)
        p
            strong GET /:id
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}64e8d3f2a2b7b2a5c1f12345

        h3 7. Get latest currency rate
        p
            strong GET /:currencyCode/latest?source=&uploader=
        p Single currency example:
            strong #{baseUrl}USD/latest?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser
        p All currencies example:
            strong #{baseUrl}ALL/latest?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser

        h3 8. Get currency rate by date
        p
            strong GET /:currencyCode/:date?skip=0&limit=10
        p Single currency example:
            strong #{baseUrl}USD/2025-08-27?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser&skip=0&limit=10
        p All currencies example:
            strong #{baseUrl}ALL/2025-08-27?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser&skip=0&limit=10

        h3 9. Get currency rate count by date
        p
            strong GET /count/:currencyCode/:date
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}count/USD/2025-08-27?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser

        h3 10. Get currency rates between two dates
        p
            strong GET /:currencyCode/:fromDate/:toDate?skip=0&limit=10
        p Single currency example:
            strong #{baseUrl}USD/2025-08-01/2025-08-27?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser&skip=0&limit=10
        p All currencies example:
            strong #{baseUrl}ALL/2025-08-01/2025-08-27?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser&skip=0&limit=10

        h3 11. Get currency rate count between two dates
        p
            strong GET /count/:currencyCode/:fromDate/:toDate
        p Example URL:
            strong #{baseUrl}count/USD/2025-08-01/2025-08-27?source=Myanmar%20Market%20Price%20App&uploader=testuser

        h2 Notes
        ul
            li All dates are handled in Asia/Yangon timezone.
            li
                strong uploadedDate
                |  cannot be in the future.
            li Use
                strong skip
                |  and
                strong limit
                |  for endpoints returning multiple results.
            li Many GET endpoints are cached for 60 seconds and auto-refresh when data changes.
